aYouHadDisturbi db 'You had disturbing dreams of a faraway jungle, an endangered prin'
                db 'cess, and the black moonstone you carried away from Britannia in '
                db 'your last adventure there.',0
aTheSpiritOfLor db 'The spirit of Lord British commanded you to find out all you coul'
                db 'd about the stone.',0
aSoYouTookItToY db 'So you took it to your old friend Dr. Rafkin, curator of the loca'
                db 'l museum of natural history, hoping that he could unravel the mys'
                db 'tery.',0
aAtDrRafkinSYou db 'At Dr. Rafkin',27h,'s, you met ace reporter and "Ultimate Adventu'
                db 'res& correspondent Jimmy Malone. Malone',27h,'s a little too nosy'
                db ' to suit you...',0
aButHeKeptHisWi db '...but he kept his wits when everything went haywire, when Dr. Ra'
                db 'fkin',27h,'s experiments on your moonstone sent the whole museum '
                db 'lab through a bizarre black moongate!',0
aYouWereShocked db 'You were shocked to lift your head and see jungle around you: Jun'
                db 'gle, and this enormous creature descending... descending upon--',0
aHerTheWomanYou db 'Her! The woman you dreamt of! A fiery tribal she-warrior of some '
                db 'time-lost land... You and your friends rescued her from the giant'
                db ' pteranodon and befriended her.',0
aSheSaidHerName db 'She said her name was Aiela, princess of the Kurak tribe, and see'
                db 'med to be quite taken with you, her most unusual rescuer.',0
aButAielaSHated db 'But Aiela',27h,'s hated suitor, Darden the Huge, prince of the Ur'
                db 'ali tribe, arrived with his men, scattering your friends and smas'
                db 'hing you into the earth.',0
aNowYouLieBroke db 'Now you lie broken and defeated, struggling to regain consciousne'
                db 'ss...',0
aCreateLzc_6    db 'create.lzc',0
aSP_7           db '%s%P',0
aOneS           db 'one %s',0
aDSs            db '%d %ss',0
aMembersOfAllTh db 'Members of all the tribes come for the feast... the largest and m'
                db 'ost important feast ever held in the Valley of Eodon.',0
aKurakSitsBesid db 'Kurak sits beside Yolaru, Pindiro beside Barako, Haakur beside Sa'
                db 'kkhra, and peace is sworn between the tribes.',0
aYouKnowThisPea db 'You know this peace isn',27h,'t for you. Soon enough, you will he'
                db 'ar the call to action again. But tonight, there is time for music'
                db ' and dance, friendship and love.',0
aAtDawnYourPast db 'At dawn, your past catches up with you... and your future beckons'
                db '. A vision of Lord British appears before you.',0
aYouHaveDoneWel db '"You have done well,& he says. "But now I must take you where you'
                db ' are needed. For the sake of the friends you leave behind, I am s'
                db 'orry. Prepare yourself.&',0
aYouSayFarewell db 'You say farewell to Aiela. "Aiela does not know your world. Take '
                db 'her there,& she pleads. "Teach her of your world.&',0
aYouShakeYourHe db 'You shake your head. "My world would strangle you. You must stay.'
                db ' My heart remains with you. But my duty is elsewhere... with him.'
                db '&',0
aTearsRollDownH db 'Tears roll down her cheeks. "Abandon duty, and you will not be th'
                db 'e warrior Aiela loves. Choose duty, and you must leave. Either wa'
                db 'y, Aiela loses all... Farewell.&',0
aYouSayFarewell_0 db 'You say farewell to Tristia. "I must go with Lord British,& you s'
                db 'ay. "My duty lies with him, though it breaks my heart.&',0
aTristiaLaughsS db 'Tristia laughs sweetly. "Tristia does not mind,& she says. "Trist'
                db 'ia has found another love: handsome Botorok. Botorok is so much b'
                db 'etter than you. Go with your chief. Go.&',0
aYouAreJoinedBy db 'You are joined by Spector',27h,'s former assistant, Fritz, who ca'
                db 'me out of hiding to fight the Myrmidex, and bears their scars.',0
aTheMoongateApp db 'The moongate appears, summoned by the shade of Lord British. Jimm'
                db 'y, Spector and Fritz gather their belongings...',0
aButRafkinDoesN db 'But Rafkin does not. "I',27h,'m staying, my friend,& he says. "So'
                db 'meone must. I will stay here... and hope other scientists come. F'
                db 'arewell.&',0
aSaddenedYouFol db 'Saddened, you follow your friends and allies into the moongate, l'
                db 'eaving the Valley of Eodon. Perhaps someday you will return to th'
                db 'ose you have left behind.',0
aCongratulation db 'CONGRATULATIONS. You have completed THE SAVAGE EMPIRE in ',0
